            "detailed_description": "Your name is Jim Stevens.<br />\r\nTom Kemer an ex fellow student is missing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTom has been struggling with life. He lost his job, his girlfriend and his home. <br />\r\nIn the last text message that Tom has sent you, he mentioned that things were working out again.<br />\r\nHe found a new home and even made new friends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter that there was no more connection. All of your messages and calls stayed unanswered.<br />\r\nYou were getting worried and decided to take a couple of days off to look for him.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLike Clay is a story driven adventure game with horror elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind out what happened to Tom by reading messages and listening to audio files.<br />\r\nSearch for hidden doors and items, solve light puzzles and survive deadly foes<br />\r\nand lethal traps.",
